      ],
      "source": "https://www.backroadstexas.net/camp-wood/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s water comes from a spring that once fed the 1762‑71 San Lorenzo de la Santa Cruz Mission and the earlier Camp Wood military outpost.",
